meta {
  name: Print Manifest
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/external/manifests/print
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "order_ids": []
  }
}

docs {
  Use this API to print the generated manifest of orders at an individual level.

  **Note**

  - Manifest needs to be generated first for this API to print it. Use the 'Generate Manifest' API to do the same.

  - Multiple order ids can be passed together.

  ##### Parameters:

  | **PARAMS** | **REQUIRED** | **DATA TYPE** | **DESCRIPTION** | **EXAMPLE** |
  |---|---|---|---|---|
  | `order_ids` | YES | _integer_ | The Shiprocket order id of whose manifest is to be generated. Multiple ids can be passed together as an array. | [16090109] |
}
